<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AFTI Safety Guide: Tractor Operation</title>
    <script src="afti-core.js?v=2"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --bg:#0f172a; --card:#1e293b; --txt:#f8fafc; --primary:#27ae60; --hud:#144d29; --accent:#ef4444; }
        body { font-family:system-ui, sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--txt); padding:20px; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; min-height:100vh; margin:0; }
        .container { width:100%; max-width:800px; background:var(--card); border-radius:14px; padding:35px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .hud-bar { background:var(--hud); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 18px; margin-bottom:25px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.9rem; }
        .task-label { background:#0f172a; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #334155; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:15px; cursor:pointer; margin-bottom:12px; }
        .task-cb { margin-top:4px; transform:scale(1.3); accent-color:var(--primary); }
        .bridge-box { background:rgba(39,174,96,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(39,174,96,0.4); padding:25px; border-radius:12px; text-align:center; display:none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="hud-bar" style="background:#7f1d1d; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
        <span>AFTI Technical Safety Module</span>
        <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'" style="background:#334155; color:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding:5px 12px; border-radius:6px; font-size:0.75rem; cursor:pointer;">🏠 Portal</button>
    </div>
    <div>
        <span style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15); color:var(--accent); font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:10px;">Operations &amp; Equipment Safety</span>
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size:1.4rem;">🚜 Tractor Pre-Start Logs &amp; Safety Checklist</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.6; color:#cbd5e1; margin-bottom:25px;">Bypassing machinery safety protocols creates immediate physical hazards and cancels land trust clearances. Complete the five core operational milestones below to clear your tool safety logs.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom:25px;">
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>1. Perform Fluid Leak &amp; Chassis Debris Audit</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Scan under the engine frame for active oil pools while clearing dry field brush away from exhaust pipes.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>2. Verify ROPS Configuration &amp; Seatbelt Lock</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Ensure the steel roll-over protection bars are pinned upright and wear your belt to anchor your safety cage.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>3. Inspect PTO Safety Shields &amp; Dressing Code</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Verify the metal spin-shield is securely casing the rear shaft while tucking loose clothing completely away.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>4. Align Hitch Lines to the Low Drawbar Frame</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Never lock pull-lines above the axle center line, eliminating rear-tipping leverage triggers completely.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>5. Enforce Low-Gear Mechanical Hillside Descent</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Use engine compression braking to crawl down sloped trails without ever depressing the clutch.</div></div></label>
        </div>
        <div id="bridge-panel" class="bridge-box">
            <h3 style="color:#4ade80; margin-top:0;">🎉 Module Complete: Tractor Safety Cleared!</h3>
            <p style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.95rem; margin:0 0 15px 0;">Your machine operations clearance has been updated inside your verified portfolio state ledger.</p>
            <button onclick="window.print()" style="background:#334155; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 20px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; margin-right:10px;">🖨️ Print Log</button>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'" style="background:#27ae60; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 20px; border:none; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer;">Return to Portal Home &rarr;</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>
    function checkProg(cb) {
        if(window.awardGlobalXP) { window.awardGlobalXP(cb.checked ? 15 : -15); }
        const cbs = document.querySelectorAll('.task-cb'); const all = Array.from(cbs).every(c => c.checked);
        document.getElementById('bridge-panel').style.display = all ? 'block' : 'none';
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
